            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Yak 1.17.30</h2>
<p>Long dictations no longer randomly lose sentences. Corrections like "one month, or actually no, two months" now keep only the fix. Numbers read one digit at a time join into one number. A "Getting Yak ready" pill shows while Yak starts up after an update. The start tick plays sooner on wired and built-in mics. No period after lol, and no ending punctuation when dictating into Finder.</p>
]]></description>
