            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Yak 1.17.22</h2>
<p>Only one Yak runs at a time now: a newer Yak closes an older copy by itself. Fewer settings: chat tidying and quick pasting of short phrases are always on. When Gemma does the cleanup, self-corrections stay on your Mac, and the fn press does less work.</p>
]]></description>
